{"title":"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:20)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:20)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder\" title=\"Remainder\">remainder</a> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fbb6a8280d5de66ddbf1dc8146f252a5c31849b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 99 \\times 999 \\times \\cdots \\times \\underbrace{99\\cdots9}_{\\text{999 9&#39;s}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"220\" height=\"35\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/7/b379ba044382bea86c6eb7d56a922c4f36b1940b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999\\equiv 9999\\equiv\\dots \\equiv\\underbrace{99\\cdots9}_{\\text{999 9&#39;s}}\\equiv -1 \\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"357\" height=\"36\" /> (see <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modular_arithmetic\" title=\"Modular arithmetic\">modular arithmetic</a>). That is a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/2/3a23f0d4269af2540ebca3f7d0eb01c9e15b11b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999 - 3 + 1 = 997$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" /> integers, so all those integers multiplied out are congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac2653dbfb4cca4ca85a5329e8b627329af0dbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- 1\\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, the entire expression is congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff3a22d4e0d27a19a5d0db1c136dccba98fafa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- 1\\times9\\times99 = - 891\\equiv\\boxed{109}\\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"325\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression also equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/62101250744f6adcc0d0230235126d5cf8fe9ac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10-1)(100-1)\\dots({10^{999}}-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"250\" height=\"21\" />. To find its modular 1,000, remove all terms from 1,000 and after. Then the expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4df5186139f87d636b5f0379015a1d9104e7c14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10-1)(100-1)(-1) \\pmod{1000} \\equiv -891 \\pmod{1000} \\equiv \\boxed{109}\\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"603\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>By maxamc\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_.7E1:20.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:20)\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:20)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:20)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/EkwhN8Kdc_Y\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/EkwhN8Kdc_Y</a>\n</p><p>~Ebai\n</p><p>Note: the problem where this is linked is covered 0:40-2:00\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/orrw4VydBTk?t=140\">https://youtu.be/orrw4VydBTk?t=140</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-GD-wvY1ADE&amp;t=78s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-GD-wvY1ADE&amp;t=78s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EMTcFZB9KvA\">https://youtu.be/EMTcFZB9KvA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I\" title=\"2010 AIME I\">2010 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2010\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261